:: fanatics-breakaway {"position": "1675,925", "size": "100,100"}
<div class="passage-content">
In general, Fanatics Breakaway jerseys are not faked.

If the jersey does ''not'' have a fight strap, and has a jock tag that looks like this, it is more than likely legit.

<img src="images/jock-tag-fanatics.png" width="500" alt="Fanatics jersey jock tag">

If you're not completely sure, you can ask in the <a href="https://reddit.com/r/hockeyjerseys/about/sticky">r/hockeyjerseys monthly legit check thread</a> or the <a href="https://discord.com/invite/hockeyjerseys">Hockey Jerseys Discord</a> for a second opinion.
</div>

